==Strategy==
Since Sunfish Jones outranges all Normal/Special Cat Units, and has a 30% chance to slow any Cats hit with his attacks, the best way to win this is using tanky short ranged Cats and luck. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and its [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]/[[Brainwashed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed]] variants are useful because they can survive multiple hits. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] will help a lot, as it takes only 1/4 damage from [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] and is quite tanky for its cost. An alternative would be to use a well timed suicide bomber such as Awakened Bahamut.

